{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50092","headline":"望远亭 · 无名氏","name":"望远亭","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"泛湖劳水戏，饮漱厌清澜。\n来登望远亭，心目又不闲。\n孤峯入座□，高岭横前轩。\n更复欢长风，萧寥窗户间。\n外物能扰人，吾将息其端。\n归来湖中馆，□户聊自安。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"无名氏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50092.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50092","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}